{"title": "Cosmic Bracken", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Cosmic Bracken</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game\">In-Game</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cosmic_Bracken.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Cosmic Bracken.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Cosmic_Bracken.jpg/250px-Cosmic_Bracken.jpg?db6ee7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Cosmic_Bracken.jpg/375px-Cosmic_Bracken.jpg?db6ee7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Cosmic_Bracken.jpg/500px-Cosmic_Bracken.jpg?db6ee7 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nBracken</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nCosmicFlowerman</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n3</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nStrangulation</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nYes</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\n5</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\nInstant Kill</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n1.25</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n0.25</div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Cosmic Bracken</b>, also referred to by its scan name as <b>Bracken?</b>, is a hostile entity and variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Bracken\">Bracken</a> added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. While its body structure is identical to the Bracken, it has blue leaves on its back, purple skin, and several white dots on its body. These white dots make the <b>Cosmic Bracken's</b> skin resemble a starry night sky, especially in the dark.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>Similar to the Bracken, the <b>Cosmic Bracken</b> will silently stalk players and attempt to sneak up behind them to snap their neck with its hands. If a player spots the <b>Cosmic Bracken</b> within the middle of their screen, it will be startled, begin to move towards its chosen room, wait, and repeat the whole process. Staring at the <b>Cosmic Bracken</b> increases the likelihood of it attempting to chase and attack the closest employee, and directly attacking the <b>Cosmic Bracken</b> instantly triggers this.\n</p><p>Any player that comes into contact with the <b>Cosmic Bracken</b> will be killed and it will attempt to drag their corpse to its chosen room. While the <b>Cosmic Bracken</b> only has a a Max Count of 1, it is only found on moons where it can spawn in every table and so players can encounter up to two on the exterior.\n</p><p>On the exterior of <a href=\"/wiki/Glimmer\" title=\"Glimmer\"><b>Glimmer</b></a>, the <b>Cosmic Bracken</b> moving through some of the flora will make it glow and release lights resembling fireflies just like it does when a player moves through it. While this is just a visual feature, it does make it easier to tell when a <b>Cosmic Bracken</b> may be sneaking up on a player.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Chances\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Chances\">&gt; Spawn Chances</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Cosmic Bracken</b> has a 25.21%, 98.08%, and a 94.72% chance to spawn in the interior, on the exterior, and on the exterior during daytime respectively on <a href=\"/wiki/Cosmocos\" title=\"Cosmocos\"><b>Cosmocos</b></a>. The <b>Cosmic Bracken</b> additionally has a 23.56%, 91.07%, and 75.32% chance to spawn in the interior, on the exterior, and on the exterior during daytime respectively on <a href=\"/wiki/Glimmer\" title=\"Glimmer\"><b>Glimmer</b></a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Bestiary_Entry\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Bestiary_Entry\">&gt; Bestiary Entry</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Cosmic Bracken</b> shares the same entry as the Bracken. If players have only scanned the <b>Cosmic Bracken</b> and wish to view the entry, they may need to type out \"cosmicbracken\" as one word into the terminal to avoid having the terminal try to route them to <a href=\"/wiki/Cosmocos\" title=\"Cosmocos\"><b>Cosmocos</b></a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Bracken <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">Bracken -- AKA flower man!<br /><br />it was flower man, you can't say othrwise! i wanted to find his body .You were the cowards<br /><br />Scientific name: Rapax-folium<br />There is debate on the genus to which the Bracken belongs. It is a bipedal vertebrate with skin the color and texture of a red beat. The name was coined for what appear to be leaves protruding from its upper spine. The purpose of these is believed to be for intimidation, however not much is known about the specifics of bracken behaviour due to its illusiveness and low population.<br /><br />We know a little from accounts by wildlife experts who have encountered it. is a lone hunter with high intelligence. Its behavior can seem aloof; it exhibits high aggression even when unprovoked, yet it quickly backs off when confronted. However, brackens are known to up their hostility when cornered or simply watched for a long time. For this reason it's recommended to keep an eye on it but not to stare it down. No specimens have been collected dead or alive. It's theorized that upon death their bodies undergo a rapid decomposition process which is unique from other large animals.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spotted</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"Found1.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Found1.mp3?305ed7\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Found1.mp3/Found1.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Angered</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"22\" data-mwtitle=\"Angered.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Angered.mp3?4ef305\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Angered.mp3/Angered.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Neck Snap</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"CrackNeck.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/CrackNeck.mp3?f164f6\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/CrackNeck.mp3/CrackNeck.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Getting Hit</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"1\" data-mwtitle=\"HitEnemyBody.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/HitEnemyBody.mp3?ff1a30\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/HitEnemyBody.mp3/HitEnemyBody.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Getting Stunned</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"1\" data-mwtitle=\"StunDog.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/StunDog.mp3?3aa5de\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/StunDog.mp3/StunDog.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:CosmicBrackenDark.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Cosmic Bracken in the dark.\"><img alt=\"The Cosmic Bracken in the dark.\" src=\"/images/thumb/CosmicBrackenDark.jpg/120px-CosmicBrackenDark.jpg?8ba029\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/CosmicBrackenDark.jpg/180px-CosmicBrackenDark.jpg?8ba029 1.5x, /images/thumb/CosmicBrackenDark.jpg/240px-CosmicBrackenDark.jpg?8ba029 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Cosmic Bracken in the dark.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:CosmicBrackenGlimmer.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"Glimmer&#39;s flora glowing as a Cosmic Bracken moves through it.\"><img alt=\"Glimmer&#39;s flora glowing as a Cosmic Bracken moves through it.\" src=\"/images/thumb/CosmicBrackenGlimmer.jpg/120px-CosmicBrackenGlimmer.jpg?88c22b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/CosmicBrackenGlimmer.jpg/180px-CosmicBrackenGlimmer.jpg?88c22b 1.5x, /images/thumb/CosmicBrackenGlimmer.jpg/240px-CosmicBrackenGlimmer.jpg?88c22b 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Glimmer's flora glowing as a Cosmic Bracken moves through it.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:CosmicBrackenCorpse.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Cosmic Bracken running off with a player&#39;s body.\"><img alt=\"The Cosmic Bracken running off with a player&#39;s body.\" src=\"/images/thumb/CosmicBrackenCorpse.jpg/120px-CosmicBrackenCorpse.jpg?dafd1e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/CosmicBrackenCorpse.jpg/180px-CosmicBrackenCorpse.jpg?dafd1e 1.5x, /images/thumb/CosmicBrackenCorpse.jpg/240px-CosmicBrackenCorpse.jpg?dafd1e 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Cosmic Bracken running off with a player's body.</div>\n\t\t</div></l